msgstr "Dalam percakapan"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/site/pages/ascii_art/intro.html.heex:10
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "It also turns a picture or a Hex Paint drawing into coloured characters."
msgstr "It also turns a picture or a Hex Paint drawing into coloured characters."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/site/pages/ascii_art/intro.html.heex:2
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/site/pages/features/real_time_chat.html.heex:33
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Make ASCII art in mIRC colours"
msgstr "Membuat seni ASCII dalam warna mIRC"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/site/pages/ascii_art/intro.html.heex:20
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Open ASCII Art"
msgstr "Buka Seni ASCII"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/site/pages/paint/intro.html.heex:23
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Open Hex Paint"
msgstr "Buka Hex Paint"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/site/pages/ascii_art/how.html.heex:4
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Open Start, then Accessories, then ASCII Art, or type /ascii in the chat."
msgstr "Buka Awal, lalu Aksesoris, lalu Seni ASCII, atau ketik /ascii dalam percakapan."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/site/pages/paint/how.html.heex:4
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Open Start, then Accessories, then Hex Paint, or type /paint in the chat."
msgstr "Buka Awal, lalu Aksesoris, lalu Hex Paint, atau ketik /paint dalam percakapan."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/site/pages/ascii_art/intro.html.heex:11
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Post the art to a chat room as one message, or copy it with its mIRC colour codes."
msgstr "Kirim seninya ke ruang obrolan sebagai satu pesan, atau salin dengan kode warna mIRC-nya."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/site/pages/ascii_art/chat.html.heex:2
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Text art arrives as one message, every character in its column, so nobody's screen fills with a flood of lines."
msgstr "Seni teks tiba sebagai satu pesan, setiap karakter dalam kolom tersebut, sehingga layar tidak ada mengisi dengan banjir baris."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/site/pages/ascii_art.ex:40
#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/site/pages/ascii_art/intro.html.heex:31
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "The word RETRO as a rainbow banner made of text characters"
msgstr "Kata RETRO sebagai spanduk pelangi terbuat dari karakter teks"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/site/pages/paint/chat.html.heex:6
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Turn it into text art with ASCII Art and it arrives as coloured characters instead."
msgstr "Mengubahnya menjadi seni teks dengan Seni ASCII dan tiba sebagai karakter berwarna sebagai gantinya."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/site/pages/ascii_art/how.html.heex:9
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Type a word, then choose File, then Post to channel."
msgstr "Ketik kata, lalu pilih Berkas, lalu Post ke saluran."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/site/pages/paint/intro.html.heex:10
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Use a pencil, lines, rectangles, ellipses and a fill, and undo any stroke."
msgstr "Gunakan pensil, garis, persegi panjang, elips dan mengisi, dan membatalkan stroke apapun."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/site/pages/paint/intro.html.heex:14
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "When it is ready, post it to a channel or a friend with a line of text, or save it as a PNG."
msgstr "Ketika sudah siap, posting ke saluran atau teman dengan baris teks, atau menyimpannya sebagai PNG."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/site/pages/paint.ex:35
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Draw pixel art in your browser for free, in sixteen retro colours, and post your drawings to a chat room."
msgstr "Gambar seni pixel dalam browser Anda secara gratis, dalam warna retro enam belas, dan posting gambar Anda ke ruang chat."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/site/pages/ascii_art.ex:39
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Free ASCII art generator: text banners in mIRC colours"
msgstr "Generator seni ASCII: spanduk teks dalam warna mIRC"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/site/pages/ascii_art.ex:35
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Make ASCII art in mIRC colours for free: text banners, pictures and pixel drawings, posted to a chat room as one message."
msgstr "Buat seni ASCII dalam warna mIRC secara gratis: banner teks, gambar dan gambar pixel, diposting ke ruang percakapan sebagai satu pesan."
